+# CONTRACT — T7 Plugin Marketplace
+
+Implementation must conform to interfaces in `src/types.ts` (read-only).
+
+## Registry (`src/registry`) — RegistryService
+- [ ] register(manifest) stores a manifest -> get returns it
+- [ ] supports multiple versions of same plugin -> listVersions returns all
+- [ ] get(name) returns latest (highest semver) version, or null if absent
+- [ ] getVersion(name, version) returns exact match or null
+- [ ] list() returns every manifest across all plugins/versions
+- [ ] search(query) matches name/description/author case-insensitively
+- [ ] remove(name, version) deletes one version, returns true; false if absent
+- [ ] update(name, version, updates) merges partial updates into manifest
+- [ ] listVersions(name) returns [] for unknown plugin
+
+## Resolver (`src/resolver`) — ResolverService
+- [ ] satisfies(version, range) wraps semver.satisfies
+- [ ] maxSatisfying(versions, range) returns highest match or null
+- [ ] validRange(range) true for valid, false for invalid
+- [ ] resolve(constraints, available) returns ResolvedVersion per satisfiable constraint
+- [ ] resolve skips constraints with no satisfying version
+
+## Runner (`src/runner`) — RunnerService
+- [ ] execute(code) evaluates code, returns success+output+duration+memoryUsed
+- [ ] context vars are visible inside the sandbox
+- [ ] runtime errors -> success:false, error message populated
+- [ ] executeWithTimeout enforces timeout -> success:false on runaway loop
+- [ ] sandbox is isolated (no access to require/process globals)
+
+## Reviews (`src/reviews`) — ReviewService (better-sqlite3)
+- [ ] addReview assigns id, createdAt, flagged=false, returns full Review
+- [ ] getReviews(pluginName) returns that plugin's reviews
+- [ ] getAverageRating excludes flagged reviews; 0 when none
+- [ ] flagReview marks a review flagged
+- [ ] getFlaggedReviews returns only flagged
+- [ ] removeReview deletes, returns boolean
+- [ ] getReviewsByUser filters by user
+- [ ] getReviewCount counts a plugin's reviews
+
+## Deps (`src/deps`) — DepsService
+- [ ] buildTree returns nested DependencyNode tree
+- [ ] buildTree terminates on cycles
+- [ ] detectCycles returns cycle paths or null
+- [ ] hasCircularDependency boolean mirrors detectCycles
+- [ ] topologicalSort orders dependencies before dependents
+- [ ] flattenDependencies lists unique transitive deps
+
+## Integration (`src/index.ts`)
+- [ ] createMarketplace() exposes all 5 services + installPlugin
+- [ ] installPlugin validates name/version/entryPoint -> throws if missing
